less in nest
less invokes math.subtractInt64
less argument left Int64 depth copy
less argument right Int64 one copy
less result smaller Int64
less ownedBy none
less cleanedBy none
less borrows none
less catch none

recurse is call
recurse in nest
recurse invokes nest
recurse argument depth Int64 smaller copy
recurse result below Int64
recurse ownedBy none
recurse cleanedBy none
recurse borrows none
recurse catch none

